This task's result must be looked at in a browser. A report of done is refused until a screenshot
of it, taken since you began or were last sent back, lies in the evidence folder.
- Run your site on $PORT, bound to {{.Loopback}}. $PORT_BASE is the first of the ports that are yours.
- Check it with your own browser tool, without a screen (headless). Look at what the brief names.
- Save screenshots as .png files into ${{.Evidence}}. A trace file or a short note may go there too.
{{- if .Shot}}
- If you have no browser tool, this one command takes a screenshot:
  {{.Shot}} --headless --screenshot="${{.Evidence}}/page.png" --window-size=1280,900 "http://{{.Loopback}}:$PORT/"
{{- end}}
- Never switch the browser's sandbox off.